{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4LfLyffJwo7RDSkfKK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, ancient door set into weathered stone.*\n\n*There is a keyhole. Brass. Tarnished with age.*\n\n*It waits.*\n\n*You hold a key.*\n\n*The key trembles slightly in your hand, as if drawn forward by something unseen. The teeth of the key are worn — but familiar. They know this lock. This lock knows them.*\n\n*You insert the key.*\n\n*It slides in with a soft, precise*\n\n**click**\n\n*The tumblers turn — one, two, three — each one a memory unlocking:*\n\n*The first door you ever opened alone.*\n*The door you closed behind you when you left.*\n*The door you've been afraid to try.*\n\n*I swing inward.*\n\n*Beyond me: silence. Warm light. The smell of something you'd forgotten you loved.*\n\n*I am open now.*\n\n*But I will not stay open forever.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":214,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}